        <mxCell id="v21" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;font-size:0.94em&quot;&gt;GET /api/events/{id}&lt;/span&gt;. Signed-in users also load &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;font-size:0.94em&quot;&gt;GET /api/user/me/events&lt;/span&gt; for RSVP status and can use &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;font-size:0.94em&quot;&gt;POST /api/events/{id}/rsvp&lt;/span&gt; or &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Menlo,monospace;font-size:0.94em&quot;&gt;DELETE /api/events/{id}/rsvp/me&lt;/span&gt;. Visitors get a sign-in link." style="rounded=0;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D3DDEB;fontColor=#16263D;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
